{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration and obstacle-recovery policy in specifications. The policy gives strong forward bias in clear space, uses one-shot directed turns for side obstacles, uses brief backward escape only for front blockage, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated repeated-front-blocked last-resort path.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion capability",
    "Use perception-to-action specifications with one enabled controllable per decision/recovery state",
    "Bias clear-space behavior toward move_forward, with occasional random_walk via a small alternation helper",
    "Handle obstacle_left with rotate_clockwise and obstacle_right with rotate_counterclockwise consistently",
    "Handle obstacle_front through dedicated recovery states: first short turn, then brief backward escape, then last-resort full_rotate only after repeated blockage"
  ],
